description: Jetpack Compose — stateless UI, hoisted state, explicit loading empty error content.
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/ui/**/*.kt"
  - "**/*Screen.kt"
---

# Compose

- State down, events up; no ViewModels passed deep into the tree.
- Render loading, empty, error, and content states explicitly.
- Collect ViewModel state with `collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`.
- Reuse design-system components; add `testTag` (and `testTagsAsResourceId` at the root when Maestro uses `id:`).
